ownload and fly crafts from SimplePlanes.com for free. Even if it does not have a fully immersive cockpit, you can still fly from the chase,  orbit, and fly-by camera modes.\n\u25cf Engage enemy aircraft with air-to-air missiles, such as the Guardian which is a highly maneuverable short-range missile, or fire and forget with the long-range Interceptor missile.\n\u25cf Assault ground threats with an extensive arsenal of air-to-ground weapons and sink ships with torpedos.\n\u25cf Multiple islands and airports to explore.\n\u25cf Several racing courses and other challenges.\n\nNote: Just to be clear, you can't build aircraft in SPVR, but you can download and fly crafts from SimplePlanes.com.\n", "short_description": "SimplePlanes VR is a flight sim with an ever-expanding collection of aircraft to download and fly for free. Airplanes, helicopters, cars, boats, and more are available and new crafts are added every day.\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://jundroo.com/privacypolicy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Jundroo, LLC", "support_website_url": "https://jundroo.com/", "website_url": "https://www.simpleplanes.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["FLYING", "SIMULATION"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "3131812133774230"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 13, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1401169601207966"}, {"status": "PUBLISH